        <mxCell id="HiR4lFsvcULXwCGS2BOl-78" parent="1" style="html=1;overflow=block;blockSpacing=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;spacing=9;strokeColor=none;strokeOpacity=100;fillColor=#ffe342;strokeWidth=0;lucidId=6UUDm85Ej3oz;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: center; text-align: center; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;[MUST] As a user...&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding-left: 10px;list-style-position: inside; list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R1 - I can upload an image containing 0 or more smiley faces via a UI interface.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R2 - I can upload multiple images in bulk for a queue.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R3 - I can browse and filter the list of uploads using name, tags, upload, and status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R4 - I can view processing status of a specific upload.  Statuses are: pending, processing, success, failed, cancelled&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R5 - I can view the results of a specific upload, which will display the original image uploaded with bounding box shown on each smiley face, along with a certainty level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;R6 - I can name and tag my uploads with location and notes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; text-align: left; align-items: baseline; font-size: 0; line-height: 1.25;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;[Nice to haves] As a user...&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0px; padding-left: 10px;list-style-position: inside; list-style-type:disc&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can take notes and mark false positives on a specific upload.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can capture false negatives on a specific upload.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I receive a notification when my upload status changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can retry a failed job.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I must log in to upload or view results.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can view other user uploads within my team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I get improved accuracy from multiple models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can group uploads into collections.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-left: 0px;margin-top: -2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:16.7px;&quot;&gt;I can feed my user-reviewed inference set results back into my model and retrain it overnight.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="512" width="530" x="-10" y="570" as="geometry" />
